<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 199-7 V WEST INDIES IN 4TH ONE-DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 199-7 V WEST INDIES IN 4TH ONE-DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 199-7 from their 50 overs against West Indies in the fourth and final one-day international at the Kensington Oval on Saturday.</p>
